1
00:00:00,531 --> 00:00:01,531
(Sheldon:)Ready?

2
00:00:01,532 --> 00:00:03,302
(Bernadette:)You bet.

3
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,930
(Sheldon:)Your name is

4
00:00:04,935 --> 00:00:06,035
(Sheldon:)Bernatrix.

5
00:00:06,036 --> 00:00:07,336
(Sheldon:)You are a warrior queen.

6
00:00:07,338 --> 00:00:10,208
(Sheldon:)You're strong,
beautiful and tall.

7
00:00:10,207 --> 00:00:14,007
(Bernadette:)Oh. I like the idea
of being tall.

8
00:00:14,011 --> 00:00:16,441
(Sheldon:)I think you're gonna like
a lot of things I have in store.

9
00:00:16,447 --> 00:00:19,047
(Sheldon:)For example, in this world,
only the men get pregnant,

10
00:00:19,049 --> 00:00:23,789
(Sheldon:)so your husband is home trying
not to pee when he laughs.

11
00:00:23,787 --> 00:00:25,757
(Bernadette:)This is getting fun.
What's next?

12
00:00:25,756 --> 00:00:27,926
(Sheldon:)You're parched and weary
from battle.

13
00:00:27,925 --> 00:00:31,195
(Sheldon:)You stand in front of a tavern
that serves the coldest,

14
00:00:31,195 --> 00:00:33,495
(Sheldon:)most delicious ale
in all the realm.

15
00:00:33,497 --> 00:00:35,867
(Bernadette:)Oh, I haven't had
a drink in months.

16
00:00:35,866 --> 00:00:37,596
(Sheldon:)What do you do?

17
00:00:37,601 --> 00:00:40,601
(Bernadette:)I storm in, slam my sword down,

18
00:00:40,604 --> 00:00:43,134
and say, “Barkeep, bring me
the strongest ale you have

19
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,470
(Bernadette:)and serve it in
the skull of a goblin!”

20
00:00:48,412 --> 00:00:50,982
(Sheldon:)He wants to see I.D.

21
00:00:53,684 --> 00:00:56,854
(Amy:)So, Claire, we've heard so many
wonderful things about you.

22
00:00:56,854 --> 00:01:01,024
(Claire:)Really? Like what?

